  "notes": "{味付|あじつ}け refers to the act of seasoning food or the resulting flavor.\n\nUSAGE:\nUsed with する: {味付|あじつ}けする (to season)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {味付|あじつ}けをする: to add seasoning\n- {味付|あじつ}けが{濃|こ}い: heavily seasoned\n- {味付|あじつ}けが{薄|うす}い: lightly seasoned\n- {味付|あじつ}けが{良|い}い: well-seasoned\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {味付|あじつ}け{海苔|のり}: seasoned seaweed\n- {味付|あじつ}け{肉|にく}: seasoned meat\n\nNOTE:\nRefers to both the seasoning process and the resulting flavor profile.",
